# The sources the stm32u5a5 build of System.Device.Gpio carries beside the library's own, one path per
# line: the GPIO driver every STM32 family with this GPIO block shares, beside the family files
# (an entry starting ./), and the csp/stm32u5a5/csharp sources it is bound with -- the generated
# layouts of the GPIO ports, the external interrupt controller and the instances, and the
# binding that hands their numbers to the driver. build-managed compiles them into that build, and
# build-boards leaves the csp ones out of each STM32U5A5 board's assembly, which references that build
# instead, so each of these types is in exactly one assembly. The rest of csp/stm32u5a5/csharp is the
# boards'.
./stm32/Stm32ExtiLines.cs
./stm32/Stm32GpioDriver.cs
./stm32/Stm32GpioPorts.cs
Stm32u5a5ExtiLayout.g.cs
Stm32u5a5GpioBinding.cs
Stm32u5a5GpioLayout.g.cs
Stm32u5a5Instances.g.cs
